      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "legend_0040_friend_15",
      "hash64": "87B11288B93D643D",
      "text": "對了，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看看這個。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
